H5711H.def:
A woman living at the time before the Flood, first mentioned at Genèse 26:34; 
daughter of: Elon (H0356); married to Esau (H6215); 
mother of: Eliphaz (H0464); also called Basemath (KJV: Bashemath) at Genèse 26:34; 
Also named: bos.mat (בָּֽשְׂמַת "Basemath" H1315H)
§ Adah = "ornament"
1) the 1st of the 2 wives of Lamech and mother of Jabal and Jubal
2) a Hittitess, 1 of the 3 wives of Esau and mother of Eliphaz
2a) also called 'Bashemath'

H5717H.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 9:12; 
son of: Jahzerah (H3170); 
father of: Maasai (H4640); also called Azarel (KJV: Azareel) at Néhémie 11:13;
Also named: a.zar.el (עֲזַרְאֵל "Azarel" H5832K)
§ Adiel = "ornament of God"
1) a prince of the Simeon of the family of Shimei in the time of king Hezekiah of Judah
2) a priest, ancestor of Maasiai
3) ancestor of Azmaveth, the treasurer of David

H5722.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 2 Samuel 23:8; also translated "wielded" or "raised"; 
§ Adino = "his ornament"
one of David's mighty warriors

H5738.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:15; 
son of: Beriah (H1283I); 
brother of: Arad (H6166B), Ahio (H0283H), Shashak (H8349), Jeremoth (H3406I), Zebadiah (H2069), Michael (H4317L), Ishpah (H3472) and Joha (H3109) 
§ Ader = "flock"
1) a Benjamite, son of Beriah, chief of the inhabitants of Aijalon
1a) also 'Eder'

H5740A.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 23:23; 
son of: Mushi (H4187); 
brother of: Mahli (H4249H) and Jerimoth (H3406K)
§ Eder = "a flock"
a Merarite Levite in the time of David

H5745.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 10:28; 
son of: Joktan (H3355); 
brother of: Almodad (H0486), Sheleph (H8026), Hazarmaveth (H2700), Jerah (H3392), Hadoram (H1913A), Uzal (H0187), Diklah (H1853), Abimael (H0039), Sheba (H7614H), Ophir (H0211), Havilah (H2341I) and Jobab (H3103)
Also named: e.val (עֵיבָל "Obal" H5858A) 
§ Obal = "stripped bare"
a son of Joktan and the founder of an Arab tribe

H5780H.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Genèse 22:21; 
son of: Nahor (H5152H) and Milcah (H4435); 
brother of: Buz (H0938), Kemuel (H7055), Chesed (H3777), Hazo (H2375), Pildash (H6394), Jidlaph (H3044) and Bethuel (H1328A); 
half-brother of: Tebah (H2875), Gaham (H1514), Tahash (H8477) and Maacah (H4601)
§ Uz = "wooded"
1) son of Aram and grandson of Seth
2) son of Nahor by Milcah
3) an Edomite, son of Dishan and grandson of Seir
4) the country of Job; probably east and southeast of Palestine somewhere in the Arabian desert

H5798A.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 6:3; 
son of: Abinadab (H0041); 
brother of: Eleazar (H0499H) and Ahio (H0283); also called Perez-uzzah at 2 Samuel 6:8; 
Also named: pe.rets uz.za (פֶּרֶץ עֻזָּא "Perez-uzzah" H6560H)
§ Uzza or Uzzah = "strength"
1) a man slain by Jehovah for touching the sacred ark
2) a Benjamite of the sons of Ehud
3) ancestor of a family of temple slaves who returned from exile with Zerubbabel
4) the garden where kings Manasseh and Amon of Judah were buried

H5798B.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:29; 
son of: Shimei (H8096M); 
father of: Shimea (H8092)
§ Uzza or Uzzah = "strength"
a Merarite Levite

H5798H.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:7; 
son of: Ehud (H0164); 
brother of: Naaman (H5283J), Ahijah (H0281K), Gera (H1617J) and Ahihud (H0284)
§ Uzza or Uzzah = "strength"
a Merarite Levite
